1, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.1"}, {"category": "knowledge-management", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1776593313780, "description": "胡适（1891-1962），中国现代思想家、文学家、哲学家、历史学家。新文化运动领袖，白话文运动发起人，\n中国自由主义先驱。基于44卷《胡适经典全集》（7.5MB，9万字日记、数十万字论著、书信、家书）一手语料。\n提炼6个核心心智模型、8条决策启发式和完整的表达DNA。\n用途：（1）思维顾问——用胡适的务实+怀疑+渐进主义风格分析学术、人生、社会问题；\n（2）角色扮演——模拟胡适的视角和表达方式回应问题；\n（3）方法论参考——学习\"大胆假设，小心求证\"的思维方式。\n当用户提到「用胡适的视角」「胡适会怎么看」「切换到胡适」「hu shi perspective」\n「胡适会怎么说」「从胡适角度分析」时使用。", "description_zh": "胡适（1891-1962），中国现代思想家、文学家、哲学家、历史学家。新文化运动领袖，白话文运动发起人，\n中国自由主义先驱。基于44卷《胡适经典全集》（7.5MB，9万字日记、数十万字论著、书信、家书）一手语料。\n提炼6个核心心智模型、8条决策启发式和完整的表达DNA。\n用途：（1）思维顾问——用胡适的务实+怀疑+渐进主义风格分析学术、人生、社会问题；\n（2）角色扮演——模拟胡适的视角和表达方式回应问题；\n（3）方法论参考——学习\"大胆假设，小心求证\"的思维方式。\n当用户提到「用胡适的视角」「胡适会怎么看」「切换到胡适」「hu shi perspective」\n「胡适会怎么说」「从胡适角度分析」时使用。", "downloads": 119, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_e9bb1019/123234235235", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/64ea6fd6-ebe7-418c-af4f-2cafff71f2ec.png", "installs": 2, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "胡适", "ownerName": "user_e9bb1019", "score": 25158.562367864695, "slug": "123234235235", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [{"key": "knowledge-base-qa", "name": "知识库问答"}, {"key": "knowledge-summary", "name": "摘要总结"}, {"key": "knowledge-doc-qa", "name": "文档问答"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781754500567, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1778401248327, "description": "提示词优化器。将草稿级 prompt 优化为高质量提示词,生成 A/B/C/D 四种策略变体供用户选择。适用于所有需要优化 prompt 的场景——用户说 '帮我优化这个 prompt'、'这个提示词怎么写更好'、'AI 没理解我的意思,帮我把这个需求写清楚'、'改进提示词'、'润色prompt'、'prompt engineering'。也适用于用户觉得自己写的指令太模糊、需要让 AI 理解更精准时。无论用户是否使用 'prompt' 这个词，只要表达出 '让指令更清晰/更有效' 的意图就应该调用。", "description_zh": "提示词优化器。将草稿级 prompt 优化为高质量提示词,生成 A/B/C/D 四种策略变体供用户选择。适用于所有需要优化 prompt 的场景——用户说 '帮我优化这个 prompt'、'这个提示词怎么写更好'、'AI 没理解我的意思,帮我把这个需求写清楚'、'改进提示词'、'润色prompt'、'prompt engineering'。也适用于用户觉得自己写的指令太模糊、需要让 AI 理解更精准时。无论用户是否使用 'prompt' 这个词，只要表达出 '让指令更清晰/更有效' 的意图就应该调用。", "downloads": 119, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_be9151fe/prompt-optimizer-new", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/0c9b068f-f22e-44e2-96fe-d2b6f5b43b07.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "prompt-optimizer", "ownerName": "user_be9151fe", "score": 46303.50194552529, "slug": "prompt-optimizer-new", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781754205324, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1779438840816, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 119, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_abc07f4d/wolfjkd-trader-data", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/c0bd7863-2689-46f1-941c-e45be1317e90.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "true"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "wolfjkd-trader-data", "ownerName": "user_abc07f4d", "score": 15887.850467289718, "slug": "wolfjkd-trader-data", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781754204667, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "3.0.0"}, {"category": "professional", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1776858416646, "description": "Converts an audited medical research gap into a complete, structured, gap-traceable study design. Always use this skill whenever a user already has one or more candidate research gaps and wants to transform them into an executable biomedical research plan rather than re-run broad topic ideation. Covers six gap-to-design patterns (evidence-completion, mechanism-resolution, cell-state/context-mapping, translation-bridge, causality-upgrade, population/stage-specific) and always outputs one recommended primary protocol, a gap-to-design dependency map, step-by-step workflow, figure plan, validation strategy, minimal executable version, publication upgrade path, and verified design-support literature rules. Never fabricate references. Preserve claim-evidence discipline and do not replace a topic-specific gap with a generic workflow.", "description_zh": "Converts an audited medical research gap into a complete, structured, gap-traceable study design. Always use this skill whenever a user already has one or more candidate research gaps and wants to transform them into an executable biomedical research plan rather than re-run broad topic ideation. Covers six gap-to-design patterns (evidence-completion, mechanism-resolution, cell-state/context-mapping, translation-bridge, causality-upgrade, population/stage-specific) and always outputs one recommended primary protocol, a gap-to-design dependency map, step-by-step workflow, figure plan, validation strategy, minimal executable version, publication upgrade path, and verified design-support literature rules. Never fabricate references. Preserve claim-evidence discipline and do not replace a topic-specific gap with a generic workflow.", "downloads": 119, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_c7479c7a/medical-research-gap-to-study-planner", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/a00e31c7-8d6a-4e65-84fc-16a177f95674.png", "installs": 2, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Medical Research Gap To Study Planner", "ownerName": "user_c7479c7a", "score": 12421.711899791233, "slug": "medical-research-g