：甲友吧，开发者微信：Rexsky2025\n\n本项目整合多部国内外权威指南与超声分类标准，为患者提供基于循证医学的主动监测决策参考，帮助患者科学理解甲状腺结节/微小癌的随访、观察与管理路径。\n\n**English:**\nThyroid Cancer Active Surveillance Assistant is an educational tool developed by Rex, creator of the WeChat public account \"甲友吧\" (Thyroid Friends Club). It provides evidence-based information and guideline-based Q&A on active surveillance for patients with thyroid nodules.\n\nThe tool synthesizes multiple authoritative clinical guidelines and ultrasound classification standards to help patients understand the follow-up, observation, and management pathways for thyroid nodules and microcarcinomas.", "downloads": 119, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_c110f235/thyroid-cancer-active-surveillance-assistant", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/a78375f1-773e-4817-b4f3-0557b6afd777.png", "installs": 5, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "甲状腺癌主动监测助手（甲友吧）", "ownerName": "user_c110f235", "score": 49790.7949790795, "slug": "thyroid-cancer-active-surveillance-assistant", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [{"key": "pro-medical", "name": "医疗健康"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781754201368, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.2"}, {"category": "dev-programming", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1776077312648, "description": "", "description_zh": "用于沉淀和维护私有组件库标准。只要用户提到组件库建设、组件新增/重构、组件 API 规范、组件文档补全、组件目录治理、组件版本变更记录、设计系统落地，都应优先使用本技能，即使用户没有明确说“组件库”。", "downloads": 119, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_c91d71f3/component-library-keeper", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/81015f94-5620-494e-bbd6-ac3268e7ccd3.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "component-library-keeper", "ownerName": "user_c91d71f3", "score": 43272.72727272727,